  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-14T21:04:25.491023Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-14T21:18:24.494409Z",
  "totalBlocks": 68,
  "translatedBlocks": 68,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3964a4eea324030",
      "translationZh": "一段时间以来，我一直在试验两种不同的非 Transformer 语言模型思路，现在正考虑将它们结合成一种架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4bad651537e2d7d",
      "translationZh": "第一种是 NORD，这是我一直在开发的一种循环／脉冲架构，围绕词元时间动态、持久状态、稀疏处理和 SNN 风格的时序计算展开。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c12f3ed183fd2aed",
      "translationZh": "第二种是 RHEA（反应式超图事件架构），我目前正在构建其约 1B 参数规模的原型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51d8b57e1ac9aa12",
      "translationZh": "RHEA 的基本思路是：模型并非让每个词元都通过固定的层堆栈，而是维护一组潜在事件，并动态选择接下来应该执行哪些内部计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55b455ea649a0ad5",
      "translationZh": "这个被我称为 ARES 的调度器会评估某个候选反应是否值得执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c250d0bf4200a1e",
      "translationZh": "一个反应可以组合已有事件，并创建一个新的潜在事件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c33dd69ace5f046",
      "translationZh": "有意思的是，我认为 NORD 和 RHEA 可能会契合得出乎意料地好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ef99996603f6e99",
      "translationZh": "NORD 感觉／时序 SNN",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14636360c82e6339",
      "translationZh": "决定哪些应该激发",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be044ce3fc64726c",
      "translationZh": "反应 反应 反应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1be87797b8ca66b1",
      "translationZh": "微回路 微回路",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cce6a03368e9996e",
      "translationZh": "大致的职责划分如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6495b55c6e3a8b7",
      "translationZh": "NORD = 时间动力学",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "01ec24328af8cabd",
      "translationZh": "局部时序计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f99797d032cdcd11",
      "translationZh": "RHEA = 认知/事件结构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8ed55bac1cd0725",
      "translationZh": "动态交互图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "853e742a724cbe1b",
      "translationZh": "创建派生事件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "32d8db131f7660f0",
      "translationZh": "多步计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "813ec5c77bb92ca0",
      "translationZh": "ARES = 执行调度器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8817abc6afaa0bd3",
      "translationZh": "估计反应的效用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3066c2857119a3b5",
      "translationZh": "将计算成本纳入考量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8cde4d4ecdd16770",
      "translationZh": "决定实际执行哪些反应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c2a4585b5a09b9b5",
      "translationZh": "允许计算深度随问题而变化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "01ff11f255545840",
      "translationZh": "我特别感兴趣的一点是，将反应算子本身构建为小型混合 SNN 微电路。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0ea5dc520e3e905",
      "translationZh": "我绝不会让整个模型都采用纯脉冲形式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d257dc120b8e0fcc",
      "translationZh": "我目前的想法是，让潜在表示和语言输出头保持稠密/BF16 形式，同时将脉冲动力学用于时序状态、记忆、事件触发以及部分反应计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b68bcb73844cc507",
      "translationZh": "词元嵌入 -> 稠密",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23c0533d23210a49",
      "translationZh": "潜在事件向量 -> 稠密",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd7f675c51d858c4",
      "translationZh": "ARES 效用模型 -> 稠密",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a778913f9bb69f73",
      "translationZh": "时序状态 -> SNN/循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a751bc5ece7d8b41",
      "translationZh": "持久记忆 -> SNN/循环",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bec45e032e66d29b",
      "translationZh": "反应动力学 -> 混合 SNN",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "178edac35602c026",
      "translationZh": "另一个让我感兴趣的部分是持久记忆。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e6489ad5e7b03a5",
      "translationZh": "一个 RHEA 事件可以写入一个缓慢变化的 NORD 记忆状态：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7db43bf97ca9287",
      "translationZh": "……数百/数千个 token……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cd780a1dddf5db0",
      "translationZh": "记忆活动超过某个阈值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "063184d804f8081d",
      "translationZh": "因此，记忆未必只是被动存储。当相关内部状态被激发时，它可以主动生成事件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bea13cd2fc162c6",
      "translationZh": "我也在考虑一种路径结晶的形式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f7e6ab1d6b5a10b",
      "translationZh": "如果系统反复执行类似下面这样的操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "43ea716e58115602",
      "translationZh": "这个反复出现的序列最终可能被提炼成一种更快的宏反应或习得的技能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95ef1816f759a33e",
      "translationZh": "在混合版本中，这也可能包括反复出现的脉冲／反应模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d596f5bb8b90c52d",
      "translationZh": "因此，该架构将跨越多个时间尺度运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf652e7a73a332d9",
      "translationZh": "NORD 脉冲／循环动力学",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f047811f12120eb2",
      "translationZh": "RHEA 反应链与推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8046abdaa8608b21",
      "translationZh": "持久记忆 + 固化技能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efca5adcdd27ca77",
      "translationZh": "我正在探索的总体原则基本上是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37a706552f2bc92d",
      "translationZh": "«计算应当跟随信息，而不是让信息始终遵循固定的计算图。»",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ec0865e309af9c1",
      "translationZh": "一个简单的输入可能只会激活系统中很小的一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97aa8eb2f53bcca8",
      "translationZh": "较难的输入可能会触发更多事件、更多反应以及更深层的计算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d1990b2891fc586",
      "translationZh": "重要的是，我并不是在声称这比 Transformers 更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f384d39604a2207",
      "translationZh": "我预想到了一些显而易见的问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ebbcba24942ae8ce",
      "translationZh": "不规则计算对 GPUs 不友好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67e42d1423d5f2aa",
      "translationZh": "稀疏/离散路由难以训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c577c26fde02604",
      "translationZh": "被跳过的反应会造成贡献归因问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6643352e822d3956",
      "translationZh": "SNN 的动态特性可能使本就困难的优化问题变得更加不稳定",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b8d4e304cfe6d023",
      "translationZh": "动态事件记忆可能会积累垃圾信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1d11c55ad2b2cf7",
      "translationZh": "要高效地对事件驱动计算进行批处理并非易事",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5af1be3c612559f3",
      "translationZh": "额外的架构复杂性可能根本无法带来超越充分优化的 Transformer/MoE 的性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1aabd616c314dc70",
      "translationZh": "在被跳过反应的信用分配方面，我目前正在试验一种反事实机制：为接近阈值的反应提供低成本预览，让调度器能够估计跳过它们是否是个错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "daec86d16c3db77b",
      "translationZh": "目前的 RHEA 原型已经在独立训练；这里描述的 NORD/RHEA 混合架构仍然只是一个设计方向，而非已经完成的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f9b6ccc3fc093f1",
      "translationZh": "我最想听听这里大家对以下问题的看法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8b6f19b103706e42",
      "translationZh": "这样的拆解是否合理？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15d455efeb32b181",
      "translationZh": "你们觉得哪个部分会最先出问题？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3237ccfb652ce067",
      "translationZh": "有没有与此特别接近的论文或项目？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ab1366631fe23d9b",
      "translationZh": "你会将 SNN 组件仅用于记忆/时序状态，还是也将其用于反应算子内部？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e3c8d49f7040f382",
      "translationZh": "这种粒度的动态计算是否可能损失过多硬件效率，以至于不值得采用？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c2c13c3769f5a7d",
      "translationZh": "我尤其希望听到从事 SNN、循环模型、MoE/路由、自适应计算或非 Transformer 架构研究的人提出的批评意见。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b640fa5ca63cceaf",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/zemondza 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
